Z||000014||RZURCTN||02-16-2000||05:14 PM||||There are those of us who are currently expanding our families and may be in the market for a minivan!  I personally don't like them, but I will buy one for hauling the family (wife, 2 kids, dog, ect.)!  I can't fit everyone into the Grand Am, carseats take up a lot of room.  I agree that you shouldn't use one for a 1 passenger daily commuter car though.  That is what my Fiero is for!  <P>Just my $1.50 worth!  Hey!  That could've bought me a gallon of gas! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000015||wkayl||02-16-2000||10:00 PM||||Leno did a thing on the Tonight Show where he went into parking lots to ask SUV owners if the ever had theirs in 4X4.  Most didn't even know how to put them in gear.  Last fall my cousin came out to Colorado from Fargo ND.  I took him on a drive above treeline that he said "wasn't in the brochure".  My wife is still trying to get me to straighten out the running boards on her truck.||||reg||1
